# Component: TodoService
## Description: Application service implementing the todo item use cases
## Dependencies: TodoRepository
## Namespace: MyApp.Application
## Version: 1.0.0

### Requirements
- REQ-2: Create, read, update and delete todo items through the repository abstraction
- Must guard against null requests

### Data Model
- TodoItem
- TodoDto

### Compliance
- complies-with ADR-0014
- satisfies M-001
